102:   function endingModal(){const strong=S.evidence.length>=7&&S.evidence.includes('autopsy')&&S.evidence.includes('witness')&&S.flags.searchFound;const title=strong?'A case, not a confession':'The town keeps its questions';const body=strong?`<p>The search yielded a hidden register and the independent timeline narrows the opportunity. Crowe remains a credible suspect, but the evidence does not prove who caused Mara’s death. The prosecutor requests continued investigation before charging.</p><p>You refuse to turn the Ninth Verse into a verdict. The case stays open; witnesses are protected and the original records are preserved.</p><div class="statusline">ENDING · RESTRAINT · EVIDENCE PRESERVED · CASE OPEN</div>`:`<p>Crowe is detained, but the case has gaps. A ledger, a scent, and a staged symbol are not a murder conviction. The county prosecutor declines charges pending corroboration.</p><p>You can keep investigating or close the file with the truth unresolved. Bellwether will remember what the papers choose to print.</p><div class="statusline">ENDING · INCOMPLETE CASE · NO CONVICTION</div>`;openModal(title,'THE SINNER’S TESTAMENT · CASE REVIEW',body,[{label:'KEEP INVESTIGATING',run:()=>{S.ending=null;closeModal();toast('CASE REMAINS OPEN · FOLLOW THE REMAINING LEADS')}},{label:'CLOSE CASE FILE',kind:'primary',run:()=>{S.ending=strong?'restraint':'unresolved';log('Case status reviewed',strong?'The case remains open for corroboration; no conviction was claimed.':'The file is marked unresolved and no conviction is pursued.');save('auto');closeModal();openModal('The town remembers','CASE STATUS · '+(strong?'OPEN':'UNRESOLVED'),`<p>${strong?'No conviction was claimed. The evidence and witness accounts remain preserved for continued investigation.':'The file is unresolved. Rumor and ritual were not allowed to stand in for proof.'}</p><div class="statusline">${S.evidence.length} EVIDENCE ITEMS · ${S.day} DAYS · ${S.ending.toUpperCase()}</div>`,[{label:'RETURN TO TOWN',ru